{"unit_id":"tag:08MC:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是带环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的一阶加厚（first order thickening）。假设给定扩张（extensions）\n<MATHSEG_0001>与<MATHSEG_0002>\n如（<REF_0001>）所述，以及映射（maps）<MATH_0002> 与 <MATH_0003>。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 如果存在 <MATH_0004>-模映射（module map）<MATH_0005> 与 <MATH_0006> 及 <MATH_0007> 相容，则图（diagram）\n<MATH_0008>\n是交换的（commutative）。\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0009>-模（module）的映射（maps）<MATH_0010> 的集合（set），其中映射与 <MATH_0011> 及 <MATH_0012> 相容，若为非空（nonempty），就是\n<MATH_0013>\n作用下的主齐性空间（principal homogeneous space）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"module map","target_term":"模映射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换的"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"nonempty","target_term":"非空"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous space","target_term":"主齐性空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯","context":"加厚的对象。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚","context":"平方零加厚。"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张","context":"给定的模扩张。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"扩张间的映射。"},{"source_term":"module map","target_term":"模映射","context":"扩张的中间模间。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"相容性图。"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换的","context":"图的性质。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"结构层上的模。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"相容映射的集合。"},{"source_term":"nonempty","target_term":"非空","context":"映射集合。"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous space","target_term":"主齐性空间","context":"Hom 群作用。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08MC:proof","translation":"(1) 直接来自这些映射（maps）的描述。对于 (2)，如果 <MATH_0001> 与 <MATH_0002> 是两个映射（maps）<MATH_0003>，与 <MATH_0004> 及 <MATH_0005> 相容，则 <MATH_0006> 分解为\n<MATH_0007>。中间的映射（map）来自 <MATH_0008> 的唯一元素（element），这是由《景上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0001> 得到的。反过来，给定此群（group）的元素（element）<MATH_0009>，可将此复合（composition）（如上所示，中间为 <MATH_0010>）加到 <MATH_0011> 上。省略一些细节。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"扩张之间的映射。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"分解中的中间映射。"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"Hom 群中的元素。"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群","context":"Hom 群。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"显示分解的复合。"}],"notes":["remark：原文省略部分细节，候选未补充。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08MD:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是带环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的一阶加厚（first order thickening）。假设给定扩张（extensions）\n<MATHSEG_0001>与<MATHSEG_0002>\n如（<REF_0001>）所述，以及映射（maps）<MATH_0002> 与 <MATH_0003>。假设图（diagram）\n<MATH_0004>\n是交换的（commutative）。则存在元素（element）\n<MATH_0005>，其为零是存在映射（map）<MATH_0006> 与 <MATH_0007> 及 <MATH_0008> 相容的充要条件。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换的"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯","context":"加厚的对象。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚","context":"平方零加厚。"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张","context":"给定模扩张。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"扩张两端的映射。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"相容性图。"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换的","context":"图的性质。"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"Ext 群中的障碍元素。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"扩张的中间模间映射。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08MD:proof","translation":"我们可显式构造扩张（extension）\n<MATH_0001>，方法是取 <MATH_0002> 为复形（complex）\n<MATH_0003>\n在中间位置的上同调（cohomology）（记号含义明显）。利用引理中的图（diagram）交换（commutes）的假设，对局部截面（local sections）作计算，表明 <MATH_0004> 被 <MATH_0005> 零化。因此 <MATH_0006> 定义了\n<MATH_0007>\n中的一个类（class）。最后，<MATH_0008> 的类（class）是扩张（extension）<MATH_0009> 沿 <MATH_0010> 的推出（pushout）与扩张（extension）<MATH_0011> 沿 <MATH_0012> 的拉回（pullback）之差（计算省略）。因此，<MATH_0013> 的类（class）为零等价于（equivalent）存在交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0014>，正如所需。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"local sections","target_term":"局部截面"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"pushout","target_term":"推出"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价于"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张","context":"模扩张。"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"用于构造 H 的复形。"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"中间上同调。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"引理中的图。"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"图的相容性。"},{"source_term":"local sections","target_term":"局部截面","context":"计算所用截面。"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"扩张的 Ext 类。"},{"source_term":"pushout","target_term":"推出","context":"沿 psi 的推出。"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回","context":"沿 phi 的拉回。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价于","context":"类消失与图存在等价。"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"扩张之间的交换图。"}],"notes":["remark：原文省略推出与拉回之差的计算，候选忠实保留。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08ME:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是带环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的一阶加厚（first order thickening）。假设给定 <MATH_0002>-模（modules）<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004> 以及 <MATH_0005>-线性（linear）映射（map）\n<MATH_0006>。如果存在序列（sequence）（<REF_0001>），满足 <MATH_0007>，则这些扩张（extensions）的同构类（isomorphism classes）的集合（set）在\n<MATH_0008>\n的作用下是主齐性的（principal homogeneous）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"序列"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous","target_term":"主齐性的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯","context":"加厚的对象。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚","context":"平方零加厚。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"给定的模。"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性","context":"映射的线性。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"I 张量 F 到 K。"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"序列","context":"模的扩张序列。"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张","context":"满足指定条件的扩张。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类","context":"扩张的同构类。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"同构类的集合。"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous","target_term":"主齐性的","context":"Ext 群作用。"}],"notes":[]}
